{"addonId": "brailleEssentials", "displayName": "P\u00eadiviy\u00ean Braille", "URL": "https://github.com/josephsl/brailleEssentials/releases/download/26.09/brailleEssentials-26.09.nvda-addon", "description": "Ev p\u00eavek ji bo bikarh\u00eaner\u00ean NVDA y\u00ean ku xwe disp\u00earin pi\u015ftgiriya braille taybetmendiy\u00ean bingeh\u00een peyda dike. Taybetmendiy\u00ean j\u00ear\u00een, ku ji Braille Extender hatine wergirtin, hene:\n\n* Du d\u00eemender\u00ean braille y\u00ean bijare bi kurtebiran ji n\u00fb ve bar bikin.\n* Gir\u00eadana otomat\u00eek a kursor\u00ea di rola term\u00eenal\u00ea de m\u00eena di PuTTY, Powershell, bash, cmd de.\n* Geroka otomat\u00eek.\n* Di navbera \u00e7end tabloy\u00ean braille y\u00ean ketin/derketin\u00ea de guheztin.\n* Niv\u00ees\u00ea bi taybetmendiy\u00ean taybet\u00ee bi r\u00eaya xala 7, xala 8 an herduyan n\u00ee\u015fan bikin.\n* Du tabloy\u00ean braille y\u00ean derketin\u00ea di heman dem\u00ea de bikar b\u00eenin.\n* N\u00ee\u015fan\u00ean tab\u00ea wek\u00ee valahiyan n\u00ee\u015fan bide.\n* Bi\u015fkok\u00ean gerandina p\u00ea\u015f \u00fb pa\u015f ve bizivir\u00eene.\n* Di dema gerandina niv\u00ees\u00ea de, \u00e7i di moda nirxandin\u00ea de, \u00e7i di moda fokus\u00ea de an j\u00ee herduyan de, r\u00eaza hey\u00ee bib\u00eaje.\n* Niv\u00ees\u00ea bi h\u00easan\u00ee bi Unicode braille werdiger\u00eene \u00fb berevaj\u00ee w\u00ea. M\u00eenak: z <--> \u2835.\n* Danas\u00eena \u015faney\u00ea veguher\u00eene Unicode braille \u00fb berevaj\u00ee w\u00ea. M\u00eenak: 123 <--> \u2807.\n* Klavyeya braille kil\u00eet bike.\n* Serl\u00eadanek/URL-\u00ea bi jest\u00ea veke.\n* Ferheng\u00ean Braille.\n* Bi yek dest\u00ee ji klavyeya braille biniv\u00eese.\n* Karakter\u00ean nediyar ji tabloy\u00ean braille (tev\u00ee emojiyan) bi karan\u00eena tems\u00eel\u00ean alternat\u00eef n\u00ee\u015fan bide.\n* Her karakterek ji klavyeya braille biniv\u00eese (tev\u00ee emojiyan).\n* Di dema gerandina niv\u00ees\u00ea de xet\u00ean vala derbas bike.\n* Moda D\u00eeroka Axaftin\u00ea.\n\n\u00db gelek ti\u015ft\u00ean din.\n\nJi bo hin d\u00eemender\u00ean braille, ew ferman\u00ean d\u00eemendera braille dir\u00eaj dike da ku van ti\u015ftan peyda bike:\n\n* Nex\u015fey\u00ean tevger\u00ean b\u00eak\u00eamas\u00ee p\u00ea\u015fk\u00ea\u015f dike, di nav de bi\u015fkok\u00ean fonksiyon\u00ea, bi\u015fkok\u00ean multimedia, nav\u00eegasyona bilez, hwd.\n* Bi\u015fkok\u00ean guherker, \u00fb bi v\u00ee reng\u00ee her kurtebirra klavyey\u00ea teql\u00eed dike\n* \u00c7end m\u00eeheng\u00ean klavyey\u00ea p\u00ea\u015fk\u00ea\u015f dike derbar\u00ea \u00eeht\u00eemala t\u00eaketina xal\u00ean 7 \u00fb 8, enter \u00fb pa\u015fveki\u015fandin\u00ea de\n* \u00c7alakiyan \u00fb nav\u00eegasyona bilez bi r\u00eaya rotor\u00ea z\u00eade dike", "sha256": "a2f006897c1462fe0d929ff0f5975335343570f25f585a4e256272e790db44ee", "addonVersionName": "26.09", "addonVersionNumber": {"major": 26, "minor": 9, "patch": 0}, "minNVDAVersion": {"major": 2025, "minor": 3, "patch": 3}, "lastTestedVersion": {"major": 2026, "minor": 2, "patch": 0}, "channel": "stable", "publisher": "josephsl", "sourceURL": "https://github.com/josephsl/brailleEssentials", "license": "GPL v2", "homepage": "https://github.com/josephsl/brailleEssentials", "changelog": "* Updated the add-on code to Braille Extender commit 38b6fa35 (2026-07-03), introducing enhanced braille support for Microsoft Excel and localization updates.\n* NVDA will honor custom braille routing commands from apps, specifically Punktum (issue 2).\n\nChanges from BrailleExtender:\n\n* No statement on add-on store based update process in add-on settings/general category (Braille Essentials does not have a self-updating mechanism).\n* Brailiant B profile: Removed Control+Alt+Tab keystroke emulation (Space with dots 5-6-8/C1+C3+C5) as it conflicts with review copy comand.", "licenseURL": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html", "submissionTime": 1788639417000, "vtScanU